Verse 1
[G]Lamp of our [Am]feet! [G]where[Am]by [D]we [G]trace [D7]Our [G]path, [D]when [G]wont [A7]to [D]stray;
[Am]Stream from the fount [A7]of [D]heav'nly grace! [G]Brook by [C]the [G]trav[D7]'ler's [G]way!

